# Thopter as well as a Construct (CR 205.1b) yet stays a 2/2 - "other creatures" - while Bot1's Ornithopter (a 0/2 Thopter) is
# a 1/3. Bot1's Memnite (an Artifact Creature - Construct) is not the chosen type and stays 1/1, and Bot2's Ornithopter, cast on
# turn two, is not under Bot1's control and stays 0/2.

